<title>USA: Cape May, N.J., won by Smith Barney.</title>
<headline>Cape May, N.J., won by Smith Barney.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney Inc said it won $4.625 million of Cape May, N.J., various general obligation bonds, with a lowest rate of 4.65, highest price of 100.0114.</p>
</text>
